we want to create a "DynamicArray" from scratch!
we want simulate "dynamic" Array (insert more item rather than current size!
                                  it automatically grow
                                  it automatically shrink)

it has some method:
                   insert()
                   removeAt()
                   indexOf()
                   print()


Note: insert()   is O(n)
                      in the increaseSize scenario
                      he need a loop on every elements
      removeAt() is O(n)
                      in the worst shift scenario we need move all element O(n)
                      when we need decrease the size we have O(n)
                      O(2n) = O(n)
      indexOf()  is O(n)
                      to find the index we need explore all element
      print()    is O(n)
                      we need loop on each element


Note: it get the size of array
      from constructor, and the future size
      will created based on this size.

